{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>By the highway we will go up.</b> Perhaps this might happen if we pass through the cities, but we will pass only by the highway, and there no cause will arise to stir up your people with the sword against us." "<b>Only there is nothing with our feet.</b> We have with us nothing ready to provoke conflict." "<b>I will pass through.</b> Since you do not refuse to let us pass except for this that you said — 'perhaps we can pass' — there is no need to be concerned about that at all."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:24.554116116Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}